  889:           cid,
  890:           segments[i],
  891:           inputs[i],
  892:           resume: short.contains(i),
  893:         );
  894:       }
  895:     }
  896:   }
  897: 
  898:   /// Segment re-downloads in flight, by cid. Kept apart from the queue's
  899:   /// [_downloadManager]: the merge runs outside [_lock], so the queue may
  900:   /// start another entry meanwhile and must neither cancel nor replace it.
